ng messages and tools. We should minimize text perhaps read 3 pages; but 52 pages / maybe 8 pages = 7 calls. The content of tool result plus existing conversation may exceed. We don't know actual budget. Let's carefully manage.\n\nWe need first check maybe page 5/6 relevant. We already have pages 1-4,6-8 evidence in prior context? Page 6-8 current? Actually catalog exposed true but no content shown here. We might need get them. The initial request likely had a lot context omitted. But remaining_paper_pages_exposed 1,2,3,4,6,7,8, not page 5. We should read 1-8 in one? Already read many but not present to model maybe need evidence. Current user message includes page 1,2,3,5 only. We need rely on get_evidence for 4,6,7,8 maybe. But we need final notes based on whole text, could read new pages and use existing notes? latest_notes empty. We must create.\n\nMaybe phase explore means we need start. We can read 1-8? We have page 1-3,5. read 4,6-8 maybe. But extraction of pages individually. Let's first use update_plan and read 4-8 maybe, plus maybe save overview note after reading. Yet note must be complete? It can be updated later. We need note on overview with categories and search methods. We already have evidence: page 1 says (1) reason, act, interact. Basic forms should be \"reason\",\"act\",\"interact\". Page 5 says initially Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM, then snowballing approach. That answers. Need exact quote supports both categories and search methods per evidence each. Categories evidence page 1 quote with all three. Search methods quote page 5 exact.\n\nBut overview note should synthesize whole paper, likely pages 1-8 and later discussion. We can draft after more reading. Still perhaps save overview note now with categories/search plus structure. But we should ensure final note is well-informed. Could update.\n\nLet's examine pages 4,6,7,8 via get_evidence maybe. get_evidence ev-000011 page 4, ev-000013 page6, 14 page7, 15 page8. Since exposed but content omitted, get will pin. Let's do it."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8545, "completion_tokens": 932, "total_tokens": 9477, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3840}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 780}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3840, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4705}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "elapsed_seconds": 7.2344470780000165, "timeout_seconds": 210.0, "remaining_seconds": 1732.5519480820003}
