nd report => maybe 20 calls. Good.\n\nFirst let's call read_pdf pages 9-12 via run_command. Need record command_result. We can perhaps in same response update plan and save notes? But must see content first. Can't note until seen. Read 9-12."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8925, "completion_tokens": 465, "total_tokens": 9390, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3840}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 318}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3840, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 5085}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.664043592999974, "timeout_seconds": 210.0, "remaining_seconds": 1728.8688195290001}
