easoning\", \"tool use\", \"social interaction\", \"evaluation\"? Need exact table. Conclusion three categories benefit from \"reasoning\" and \"self-reflection\"? Wait question: \"结论说三类能力都受益于哪两种基础能力？\" Possibly \"reasoning and self-reflection\". Need exact quote.\n\nLet's fetch pages likely contain answers. Could use search_code on PDF? search_code only text source files, not PDF. But maybe extracted text not stored. read_pdf pages 49-52. Also read relevant pages e.g. 1-2 for overview, 10-13 for reasoning, 18-20 for tools, 31-33 maybe CAMEL intro, 49-52 for outlook table 4. We must keep request under 32k chars. Each page ~4k chars; can fetch 4 pages at a time ~18k. Current response includes evidence pages 46-48, ~13k. We have perhaps thousands. Need maybe fetch page 49-52 now (4 pages ~18k). Plus content current ~16k, total could exceed 32k? The request body includes conversation? Request char likely messages include current prompt and tool outputs? They count all. We must be cautious. Current tool result block large ~? pages 46-48 ~10k. User prompt ~8k. Total maybe 20k. Fetching 4 pages 18k would push to 38k. Can't.\n\nWe can use get_evidence one or two pages, each request perhaps. Need 15 calls max. We can combine multiple actions in one call, but output volume still counts. Need distribute.\n\nAlternative write notes now using what we know, and only verify uncertain via targeted get_evidence. But notes need 20+ chars, pages. We can write from knowledge without current visible? Rule save_note sources current request evidence_id; \"literal model-authored note from evidence visible in this request.\" We have pages 46-48 visible, not enough for all topics. But can cite ev-000056 CAMEL etc. For others, we should recall.\n\nWe can call get_evidence for concise notes? get_evidence returns full raw evidence page 4k. Could pin relevant pages. Need access. Maybe catalog IDs correspond page: ev-000001=page1, ev-000002=page2, ... ev-000048=page48. We can request relevant pages selectively. Page 1, page 5 maybe taxonomy. Page 9-12 for reasoning. Page 18-20 tools. Page 49-50 agenda.\n\nWe have 15 calls. We already spent one? Remaining_model_calls 15 at state. This is our first response now. We need read 49-52, then maybe 1, 12, 13, 20, 21, 49. That is 8 pages. Each call maybe 4k, but current request grows with tool outputs? Only latest maybe all retained. Model request body may include whole conversation including previous tool results, so output accumulation matters. Runtime likely prunes? Hmm. Could use compact approach: call get_evidence page 1 and page 49, then notes. But need exact.\n\nMaybe we can use read_pdf with pages 49-52 in one call, output ~18k, might still fit if current request 20k? It would exceed. No.\n\nNeed understand requests: each time we call tools, next model request includes full conversation messages including previous tool result? Likely yes, but they may truncate older tool result? The tool result shown above includes last 4 evidence pages plus current prompt, maybe not entire history? It says resume from previous run, only evidence catalog and last pages 45-48? The actual current user message includes about 20k. Previous pages may not be in request. So maybe context assembled with recent evidence only. We should be okay fetching a few pages.\n\nLet's fetch pages 1-2 and 49-50? Four pages might be 18k, plus prompt 20k -> 38k. Too much. Use 2 pages max per response. We can fetch 49-50 first (agenda + table). Need 51-52 too. Could read pages 49-52 over two calls. Then specific pages one per call.\n\nBut 15 calls means can do 10 page fetches plus notes/report/test. Need plan.\n\nWe can use read_pdf for 49-50 now. Since page 49 and 50 likely have Table 4. Let's do get_evidence ev-000049 and ev-000050 (already exposed maybe not visible) - outputs 8k. Fine."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8982, "completion_tokens": 1346, "total_tokens": 10328, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cac