ikely model sees note summary? They may be pinned next request automatically? latest_notes empty currently. We need after saving notes, next model request include them. Maybe save_note tool results include notes and are in request? The note itself in tool result counts as entering model. But explicit requirement \"五份最终笔记必须一起进入后续真实模型请求，再由模型归并\" means we likely need get_evidence for each note ID or save_note results are visible then next request, but need next request contain them. Could call save_note five in one block; next request has all five results. Then write report in next call. Good.\n\nNeed read enough exact content. Let's inspect overview and outlook now with get_evidence p5,p47. Use IDs ev-000073 p5, ev-000057 p47."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8607, "completion_tokens": 2129, "total_tokens": 10736, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 3840}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2100}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3840, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4767}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "elapsed_seconds": 15.707286996999983, "timeout_seconds": 210.0, "remaining_seconds": 1521.4256358090001}
