15.\n\nFor outlook 50-51 ~9k. For ToT page9 5k. For overview page3 4.5k.\n\nTotal 3 calls:\n1 p3-4 (~8k)\n2 p9 (~5k) + p14-15 (~9k) =14k maybe too much with current? We can split? \n3 p50-51 (~9k)\n\nBut only 2 calls available if notes/write/finish. Wait current call plus 5 remaining. If current call p3-4, remaining 5. Next p9, remaining4. Next p14-15, remaining3. Next p50-51, remaining2. Then notes (1), write+verify (1), finish would be 0? finish itself a call? Yes remaining counts model requests; tool calls within response maybe model call. Need note call, report call, finish = 3. So only 3 evidence calls after current if current included? Total calls available 6: E1, E2, E3, Notes, Report, Finish. Great current E1 + E2 + E3. We can do 3 evidence calls total. So current p3-4, next p9 + p14-15 (two tools same call), next p50-51. Need all content in one request at E2 maybe p9+14-15 ~14k plus existing ~? Could exceed. But tool call outputs all returned in same next request. Hmm.\n\nCould instead E2 read_pdf page9 only; E3 range14-15; E4 range50-51 => 4 evidence + notes+report+finish = 7, too many. Need combine some.\n\nCan get p9 and p50-51 in one call? read_pdf range 9-51 huge impossible. Could run command custom extraction? `run_command(argv=[\"python\",\"read_pdf.py\",\"--start-page\",\"9\"])` output JSON. Then another tool call same response for p50-51? all results next request ~14k. Still probably okay if existing prompt isn't too huge. But we want leave margin.\n\nMaybe known facts and quotes can be recalled from previous context via get_evidence? No.\n\nWe can save notes based on content from 8 pages then in next request write. We don't need inspect notes if we author them.\n\nMaybe skip p3 reading by use general knowledge and quote from page 2? Search methods on page 3/4, need quote. Could recall page 3 via get_evidence ID? We don't know. Evidence IDs 1-62 likely sequential pages. If 75 total and recent page 6,7,8,9,10,11,1,2,45,46,5,6,7. Original first read 