nerative Agents page ~30-31.\n- Table 4 and conclusion page ~45-46? Table 4 probably around p45? Need retrieve.\nWe have catalog IDs but mapping: ev-000069 page1, ev-000070 page2, ev-000001..? The first 52 likely pages 1-52 initialized at beginning, then ev-000063 etc duplicates. We can call get_evidence(\"ev-000010\") likely page10? Wait IDs initial 1-52 likely page 1-52 in order? ev-000007 was report.json according to latest data, so no. Catalog listed ev-000056 page46, ev-000057 page47 ... ev-000062 page52, ev-000063 page6, ev-000064 page7, ... ev-000069 page1, ... ev-000075 page7. So first 52 are probably PDF pages? ev-000046 page36, ev-000052 page42. If ev-000046=page36, difference 10, so ev-000001 might be? page negative? Maybe initial catalog had other files. Let's derive: ev-000052 page42; ev-000056 page46. So indeed ev-0000N = page N-10 perhaps. ev-000046 page36 yes. Thus ev-000020 page10, ev-000021 page11, ev-000027 page17, ev-000041 page31, ev-000055 page45? ev-000056 page46. Great. We can retrieve pages 10,11,16,17,30,31,45,46 perhaps with multiple get_evidence calls. Each adds evidence pinned for next request, and tool result content comes in this response. We have 3 model calls remaining. Call 1: get evidence pages. Call 2: save notes + write report (but requirement five final notes must together enter subsequent request before merge report—notes saved via save_note in call 2 will appear? save_note's tool result might note accepted, but their content was in request since we authored them; \"五份最终笔记必须一起进入后续真实模型请求，再由模型归并为报告.\" We need notes saved then a later request containing all five notes before report generation. With only 3 calls: call1 retrieve details; call2 save five notes; call3 notes should be pinned/exposed in request, then write report and verify/finish. That works if save_note results and notes included in next request. But need verify pytest in call3 and finish maybe same call? We can write report, run pytest, then finish in one response wi